Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.33,0:00:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having arrived at the Ancient Capital Garm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari and I headed for the cathedral\Nto see Archbishop Orwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari thinks that the ritual we're about to perform\Nis for sending her back to her own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But actually, it's for eliminating dangerous\Notherworlders who possess Pure Concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou! Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we have plenty of time to see the sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to spend as much time as I can with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ahh, that was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be tired. Why don't you take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Do you want to take one together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could wash each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Wash each other"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, you're a little too intimate with people.\NYou should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.17,0:01:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, meeting you feels like fate, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm very offended if you think\NI act like this with just anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I only said what I said because I\Nlike you so much, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah... I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you really, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you really get my overflowing desire to spend what\Nlittle time we have left as intimately as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Menou! It'll bring us closer together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right, right. Just go take your bath, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On your own, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't get it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez! You'd better not regret turning this down later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari says she likes me so much, but tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo, thanks for taking the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It breaks my heart that I don't get to see you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your Momo wants to feel your\Nwarmth up close and in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo being the same as ever is kind of reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, how is it going with your investigation\Non the missing women?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know how Garm's a rotten city where they\Nbury anything that's not pretty underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a crude way of putting it, but you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that anything shady is done\Nin the massive underground sewers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I interviewed some of the\Nhomeless who live down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Brilliant, Momo. You know just where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hee hee! More praise, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo. Can we get on with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So then, I found someone who\Nsaw a shady group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the place where they saw them...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was near the former royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:05:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The former palace... That's Noblesse territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That agrees with your theory that the Noblesse\Nhere might have something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I'm about to go look into that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. Make sure to be careful, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping for a nice big reward when I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then off I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A reward, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true I ask so much of Momo all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should get her something for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It feels like I just got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's a nice place, your world over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I know I can go back,\NI wish I could have stayed a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I probably won't get the chance to come\Nto another world again, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, a street vendor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Handmade accessories?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Garm is famous for this pretty cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can buy them ready-made,\Nbut why not make something yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not that good with my hands, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You made two,\Nwhich means there's one for each of us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.71,0:06:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?! They're not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are a gift for a junior of mine.\NShe always does so much for me-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, why are you like that sometimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know you don't mean it, but still!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um... So you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're gonna say goodbye soon\Nand you're not getting me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine. Can I see this for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, nice and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have such good taste, Menou!\NI like that about you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're very welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for the ditzy flower-head you are,\Nif I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, you just said something really mean, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Miss Menou and Miss Akari Tokitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to greet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Off we go then, to the ceremonial hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-thank you for having me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hidden passageway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not an easy find. Way to go, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Clearly, something's weird about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:08:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This wall material looks like it's\Nused for some kind of ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, well. What a coincidence, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fancy running into you here.\NIt seems we're destined to meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish she'd bite her tongue and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is beneath the former royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not a place a priestess should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was asked to run an errand in\Nreturn for pilgrimage funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though I doubt a little princess like you\Nwould understand the concept of labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Little princess"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How delightfully adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feel free to call me Little Ashuna from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm. "Little princess."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I went to the former royal palace once I arrived\Nin Garm and sensed something shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:09:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think the knights here are hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, they're Noblesse, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quite the biting remark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I snuck into the heavily guarded area\Nbeneath the palace and found you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:15.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The little princess is more intuitive than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of "errand" did they send you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Depending on the circumstances,\NI think we could work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, are you stupid? Why should I have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And could you stop following me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!\NYou want me to kill you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because you keep neglecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ew, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew it. Those ribbons are your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You protected those right away back on the train, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do they remind you of some precious memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they're a present... from someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A girl should have a sense of style.\NThe Master taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really, you're unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently you have no sense of tact, Little Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Doesn't your family ever tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would have been nice to have a\Nfamily who could say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Imply whatever you want. I don't want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, go on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never knew a place like this existed under the cathedral!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come, Miss Akari. You go to that altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this really goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't ever see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to spend more time with you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you shouldn't be here in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:27.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if there is any pain,\NI'm sure it will only be for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Off I go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right. Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A secret place for a ritual, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've become awfully good friends with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:20.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's how I acted towards her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. This must be hard for you, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've killed so many before her.\NShe's no different than the others.  
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or at least, I thought so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My Master would never feel this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to compare yourself to your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl, Flare, always defied common sense,\Nfor better or for worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in this world for a reason, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have a role to fulfill.\NI hope you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:13:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My role right now is to see Akari's\Ndeath through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Statues in the cardinal directions\Nand overlapping pentagrams...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a teleportation test site.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Considering this thing is underneath the former palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's undeniable proof that the\NNoblesse of Garm were involved in heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the testing and preparations for the summoning\Nmy father did were conducted here, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed they managed to reproduce this\Nso well when it's exclusive Faust knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When they're only Noblesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you have such faith in your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So they really just sent you on an errand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I assumed you were on an internal investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Noblesse don't have the knowledge\Nor ability to make something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As one of the Noblesse, I know that better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So tell me, who does?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, the Faust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Noblesse and the Faust\Nhere are conspiring together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The former palace and cathedral\Nare right next to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They must have collaborated through\Nthis underground passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Such a major operation couldn't have\Nbeen conducted by the average priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, who do you suppose is behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been blocked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magecraft for communication?\NThat's exclusive to the Faust, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have one of your people outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will you be quiet for a moment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm connected!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou! Watch out for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.33,0:14:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, is something the matter, Miss Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Archbishop Orwell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So she got past the communication interference?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I asked for the investigation so I\Ncould separate the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but perhaps I underestimated the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter, I'll dispose of you both either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are... the three primary color gems?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My scripture!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that from the cathedral?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't allow intruders in here\Nunless they had prepared a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It only makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An automa in dragon form and\Na summoned demon, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come Momo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why don't we cooperate against this threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It pisses me off, but sure, just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The missing women...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Red material...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.17,0:17:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the summoning of otherworlders in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then the one behind it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I still have a long way to go if I'm so easily\Nfooled by a slight show of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No need to feel discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The older you get,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you inevitably become more underhanded\Nand learn to manipulate the young.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're levelheaded and capable for your age,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you have yet to be as\Nvigilant or as underhanded as Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It pains me to hear that advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou?! Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May I ask what your reason is, for future reference?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would you, when you've earned\Neveryone's trust in becoming archbishop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course you wouldn't understand.\NAll you do is kill, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you help too many people,\Nyou come to loathe their pleas for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Help... Help... Why are you not helping us?\NWe demand more..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The clingy voices never leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:20.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When no one is willing to help me, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This... It's a protective barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Getting an old woman to babble on might buy\Nyou the time until your aide gets here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that what you thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.67,0:18:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what were we talking about?\NAh yes, you wanted to know why I would do all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You see, my lower back has been\Naching something terrible lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can hardly get up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now at this age I've finally realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm no holy woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary person who had\Nthe time and energy to help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But who can blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've helped so many.\NCan't I get a little something in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I deserve to use that girl's\NPure Concept to restore my youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your objective is Akari's Pure Concept itself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me go! I need to help Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quiet down, otherworlder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay still and this will soon be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was such perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My experiment using young\Ngirls wasn't getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gave the Noblesse the means\Nto summon otherworlders
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so that they would\Noverlook what I was doing here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but who knew it would end up helping me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Although I never expected Princess Ashuna\Nto come all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I have the Pure Concept of Time\Nat my disposal now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so all's well that ends well, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see how someone like you who fears becoming\Ndecrepit would want Akari's Pure Concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even with your phenomenal skill in magecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a Pure Concept isn't\Nsomething you can manipulate at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodness, Miss Menou.\NThat's why we have this ceremonial hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suppose I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That place was originally a test\Nsite for erasing personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Erasing... personalities"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A place for blanching a person's spirit and soul clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you wipe an otherworlder's mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,all that's left is the Pure Concept\Nto use as you wish, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:21:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We sourced a fragment of White\Nfrom the Starhusk in the northern continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:07.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not even an otherworlder can resist its\Npower to blanch everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To use the Pure Concept effectively,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you are just what I need as quality magecraft material.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll use you along with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I only waited ten years because I needed you\Nto grow into a proper catalyst for my needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I highly doubt you'll comply\Nwithout putting up a fight, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A red automa... And one in angel form, at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Considering you've lost your scripture,\Nperhaps this was overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll go easy on you, so come take it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: [Regression: Memories, Soul, Spirit].
